# Medical Insurance Charges Prediction

## 🎯 Project Aim

The aim of this project is to build a **Machine Learning regression model that predicts medical insurance charges** based on customer demographic, lifestyle, and health-related information.

The project focuses not only on building a model, but also on understanding how different features influence medical charges and comparing multiple regression algorithms to identify a suitable final model.

---

## 📊 Dataset

The dataset contains **1,338 records** and the following 7 columns:

| Feature    | Type                  | Description                            |
| ---------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `age`      | Numerical             | Age of the individual                  |
| `sex`      | Categorical           | Gender of the individual               |
| `bmi`      | Numerical             | Body Mass Index                        |
| `children` | Numerical/Categorical | Number of children/dependents          |
| `smoker`   | Categorical           | Smoking status                         |
| `region`   | Categorical           | Residential region                     |
| `charges`  | Numerical             | Medical insurance charges — **Target** |

### Target Variable

```text
charges
```

The objective is to predict the medical insurance charges for a given individual.

---

